---
source: crates/leptoskit_cli/src/cloud/tests.rs
expression: help
---
Manages an environment's custom domains

Usage: domain [OPTIONS] <COMMAND>

Commands:
  list    Lists the environment's domains and the DNS records each needs
  add     Attaches a domain and shows the DNS records to publish
  verify  Looks for the domain's challenge record and marks it verified
  remove  Detaches a domain; requires the hostname again as confirmation
  help    Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
      --url <URL>
          Cloud origin; overrides `LEPTOSKIT_CLOUD_URL` and [cloud].url

      --json
          Prints the documented JSON result

      --org <ORG>
          Organization slug; defaults to [cloud].organization or your personal one

      --project <PROJECT>
          Project slug; defaults to [cloud].project

  -e, --environment <ENVIRONMENT>
          Environment name, for the commands about one; defaults to production

  -h, --help
          Print help
